        "maxCyclomatic": 30,
        "reason": "This is an exhaustive `switch (descriptor.routeKey)` over a closed 13-member union \u2014 the flat-not-nested shape the brief names as the legitimate waiver case. Only cyclomatic (26) exceeds; cognitive is 16, comfortably under the 20 ceiling, because there is no nesting: each arm is a sibling `case` tha"
